  "content": "<p>此資源包將預設的紅石粉紋理替換為<strong>直線</strong>設計。紅石不再灰塵滿天飛了 =)</p><p>使用此資源包時：</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/6M5wtKRm/images/bbf70288b61e56ae1fdab75f2484db511a29e8eb.png\" alt=\"紅石粉放置時呈現直線\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/6M5wtKRm/images/5188c7ab3cca1b9080184ce3464ff6bbc02a7ad4.png\" alt=\"來玩西洋棋吧\"></p>",
